    "Place one foot on a low surface, keep your leg straight, and lean forward. Hold 15 seconds each side." : {
      "comment" : "Exercise description",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bir ayağınızı alçak bir yüzeye koyun, bacağınızı düz tutup öne eğilin. Her iki tarafta 15 saniye bekleyin."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "片足を低い台に乗せ、脚を伸ばしたまま前に体を傾けます。左右それぞれ15秒保ちます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Place your hands on your hips and rotate them in wide circles. 10 clockwise, 10 counterclockwise." : {
      "comment" : "Exercise description",
