    "macOS requires Location Services permission to read the current Wi-Fi name (SSID). StandLock reads only the current SSID; it never reads or stores coordinates." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在接続中のWi-Fi名（SSID）を読み取るにはmacOSの位置情報サービスの許可が必要です。StandLockは現在のSSIDだけを読み取り、座標を取得・利用・保存しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi checking is stopped while StandLock is off" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StandLockがオフの間、Wi-Fiの確認を停止しています"
